Start.
Open UiPath Studio.
Create a new process.
Launch the Chrome browser.
Open the Amazon website (https://www.amazon.in).
Enter "Laptop" in the Amazon search box.
Click the Search (🔍) button.
Wait for the search results page to load.
Use Extract Table Data to extract the required details (such as Product Name, Price, and Rating).
Store the extracted data in a DataTable (dtAmazon).
Open or create an Excel file (AmazonLaptop.xlsx) using Use Excel File.
Use Write Range to write the DataTable into Sheet1 starting from cell A1.
Save and close the Excel file.
End the process.
